{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T075615731Z-b7143bdb:1","run_id":"20260904T075615731Z-b7143bdb","timestamp":"2026-09-04T07:56:15.732Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"flash","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","reviewer_hash":"41d823fa","severity":"error","text":"The run function has no doc comment stating its purpose or enumerating its domain failure modes. It must add a doc comment (like the exemplar) that states the service's purpose in one sentence and lists every failure mode (unknown parlor, invalid coupon) so a caller can handle every error without reading the body.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-2559f7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
